      "prov:value": "### Measured Result"
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/reference/developer-mode.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Conclusion for Developer Mode",
      "prov:value": "Therefore, practical Developer Mode on workstations should configure:\n```json\n{\n  \"topology\": {\n    \"toolSurface\": \"both\"\n  }\n}\n```\nor run an MCP server alongside local CLI tooling until CLI shims for workflow operations are implemented."
    },
